IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P9-gate`
IMPORT `P9-art-112`

-- Tests for Article 112. Expected values are written from the text of the Article and Article 113 (the group General from 2 August 2026;
-- the Regulation entered into force on 1 August 2024), never copied from the encoding's output. Article 112 is not changed by the Omnibus
-- (27 July 2026). Each deadline is tested on the last day (within) and the day after (BREACH); each rule before the group applies owes nothing.

§ `Article 112(1): the yearly assessment`

-- The n-th assessment is due by the n-th anniversary of the entry into force (1 August 2024).
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the day by which the assessment for the year must be made` 1 EQUALS Date 1 8 2025
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the day by which the assessment for the year must be made` 3 EQUALS Date 1 8 2027
-- args: date asked, the period of the delegation of power laid down in Article 97 has ended
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the Commission must assess the need for amendment of the lists in Annex III and Article 5` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the Commission must assess the need for amendment of the lists in Annex III and Article 5` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the Commission must assess the need for amendment of the lists in Annex III and Article 5` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- args: date asked, the delegation period has ended, the number of the year, the day from which the time is counted. Year 3 began on 1 August 2026.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to assess the need for amendment once a year` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE 3 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(1) assess the need for amendment of the list set out in Annex III and of the list of prohibited AI practices laid down in Article 5` AT (Day (Date 1 8 2027))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to assess the need for amendment once a year` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE 3 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(1) assess the need for amendment of the list set out in Annex III and of the list of prohibited AI practices laid down in Article 5` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2027))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to assess the need for amendment once a year` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE 3 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 8 2027))
-- The delegation period has ended, the year number is not positive, or the group does not apply yet: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to assess the need for amendment once a year` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE 3 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 8 2027))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to assess the need for amendment once a year` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE 0 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 8 2027))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to assess the need for amendment once a year` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE 3 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 8 2027))
-- args: date asked, the Commission has assessed
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the Commission must submit the findings of that assessment to the European Parliament and the Council` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the Commission must submit the findings of that assessment to the European Parliament and the Council` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(1) the Commission must submit the findings of that assessment to the European Parliament and the Council` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(1) the duty of the Commission to submit the findings of the assessment to the European Parliament and the Council` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(1) submit the findings of that assessment to the European Parliament and the Council` AT 5

§ `Article 112(2): the report by 2 August 2028 and every four years`

#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the day by which the Commission must evaluate and report` 1 EQUALS Date 2 8 2028
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the day by which the Commission must evaluate and report` 2 EQUALS Date 2 8 2032
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the day by which the Commission must evaluate and report` 3 EQUALS Date 2 8 2036
-- args: date asked, the number of the report, the day from which the time is counted
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(2) the duty of the Commission to evaluate and report` (Date 2 8 2026) 1 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(2) evaluate and report to the European Parliament and to the Council on the matters of paragraph 2` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2028))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(2) the duty of the Commission to evaluate and report` (Date 2 8 2026) 1 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(2) evaluate and report to the European Parliament and to the Council on the matters of paragraph 2` AT (Day (Date 3 8 2028))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(2) the duty of the Commission to evaluate and report` (Date 2 8 2026) 1 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2028))
-- The second report is due four years later: 2 August 2032 is within the time, 3 August 2032 is not.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(2) the duty of the Commission to evaluate and report` (Date 2 8 2030) 2 (Date 3 8 2028) AT (Day (Date 3 8 2028)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(2) evaluate and report to the European Parliament and to the Council on the matters of paragraph 2` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2032))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(2) the duty of the Commission to evaluate and report` (Date 2 8 2030) 2 (Date 3 8 2028) AT (Day (Date 3 8 2028)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2032))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(2) the duty of the Commission to evaluate and report` (Date 1 8 2026) 1 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2028))
-- args: date asked, the matter
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the Commission must evaluate and report on the matter` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 112(2)(a) the need for amendments extending existing area headings or adding new area headings in Annex III` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the Commission must evaluate and report on the matter` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(2)(a) the need for amendments extending existing area headings or adding new area headings in Annex III` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the Commission must evaluate and report on the matter` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(2)(b) amendments to the list of AI systems requiring additional transparency measures in Article 50` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the Commission must evaluate and report on the matter` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(2)(c) amendments enhancing the effectiveness of the supervision and governance system` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(2) the Commission must evaluate and report on the matter` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(2) another matter` EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, the point
#ASSERT `Art 112(4) the reports referred to in paragraph 2 must pay specific attention to the point` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 112(4)(a) the status of the financial, technical and human resources of the national competent authorities` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(4) the reports referred to in paragraph 2 must pay specific attention to the point` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(4)(a) the status of the financial, technical and human resources of the national competent authorities` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(4) the reports referred to in paragraph 2 must pay specific attention to the point` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(4)(b) the state of penalties, in particular administrative fines as referred to in Article 99(1), applied by Member States for infringements of this Regulation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(4) the reports referred to in paragraph 2 must pay specific attention to the point` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(4)(c) adopted harmonised standards and common specifications developed to support this Regulation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(4) the reports referred to in paragraph 2 must pay specific attention to the point` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(4)(d) the number of undertakings that enter the market after the entry into application of this Regulation, and how many of them are SMEs` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(4) the reports referred to in paragraph 2 must pay specific attention to the point` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 112(4) another point` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 112(3): the report by 2 August 2029 and every four years`

#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the day by which the Commission must submit the report` 1 EQUALS Date 2 8 2029
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the day by which the Commission must submit the report` 2 EQUALS Date 2 8 2033
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(3) the duty of the Commission to submit the report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) 1 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(3) submit a report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation to the European Parliament and to the Council` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2029))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(3) the duty of the Commission to submit the report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) 1 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(3) submit a report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation to the European Parliament and to the Council` AT (Day (Date 3 8 2029))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 112(3) the duty of the Commission to submit the report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) 1 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2029))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(3) the duty of the Commission to submit the report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation` (Date 1 8 2026) 1 (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2029))
-- args: date asked, the report has been submitted
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the reports must be made public` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the reports must be made public` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the reports must be made public` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(3) the duty of the Commission to make the reports public` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(3) submit a report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation to the European Parliament and to the Council` AT 5
-- args: date asked, the findings are available, it is appropriate to accompany the report with a proposal
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the report must be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the report must be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the report must be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 112(3) the report must be accompanied by a proposal for amendment of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 112(5), (6), (7)`

-- args: date asked, the day from which the time is counted. By 2 August 2028.
