§ `Article 112(8) to (12)`

-- args: date asked, the Commission has requested the information for the purposes of paragraphs 1 to 7
#ASSERT `Art 112(8) the Board, the Member States and national competent authorities must provide the Commission with information` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(8) the Board, the Member States and national competent authorities must provide the Commission with information` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(8) the Board, the Member States and national competent authorities must provide the Commission with information` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(8) the duty of the Board, the Member States and national competent authorities to provide the Commission with information` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Board, a Member State or a national competent authority` DOES `Art 112(8) provide the Commission with information upon its request and without undue delay` AT 5
-- args: date asked, the Commission is carrying out an evaluation or review
#ASSERT `Art 112(9) the Commission must take into account the positions and findings` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(9) the Commission must take into account the positions and findings` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(9) the Commission must take into account the positions and findings` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(9) the duty of the Commission to take into account the positions and findings` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(9) take into account the positions and findings of the Board, of the European Parliament, of the Council, and of other relevant bodies or sources` AT 5
-- args: date asked, it is necessary to submit proposals
#ASSERT `Art 112(10) the Commission must submit appropriate proposals to amend this Regulation` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(10) the Commission must submit appropriate proposals to amend this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(10) the Commission must submit appropriate proposals to amend this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(10) the duty of the Commission to submit appropriate proposals to amend this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(10) submit appropriate proposals to amend this Regulation` AT 5
#ASSERT `Art 112(11) the AI Office must undertake to develop an objective and participative methodology` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(11) the AI Office must undertake to develop an objective and participative methodology` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(11) the duty of the AI Office to undertake to develop an objective and participative methodology` (Date 2 8 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the AI Office` DOES `Art 112(11) undertake to develop an objective and participative methodology for the evaluation of risk levels` AT 5
-- args: date asked, the amendment, delegated act or implementing act concerns sectoral Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I
#ASSERT `Art 112(12) the amendment or act must take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 112(12) the amendment or act must take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 112(12) the amendment or act must take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(12) the duty to take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(12) take into account the regulatory specificities of each sector and the existing governance, conformity assessment and enforcement mechanisms and authorities` AT 5

§ `Article 112(13): the assessment of the enforcement by 2 August 2031`

