#TRACE `Art 112(13) the duty of the Commission to assess the enforcement of this Regulation and report` (Date 2 8 2026) (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 112 the Commission` DOES `Art 112(13) carry out an assessment of the enforcement of this Regulation and report on it to the European Parliament, the Council and the European Economic and Social Committee` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2031))
-- EXPECT BREACH
