-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17 (the lead's not-precedence sweep): the four duty rules of Art 112(2), (3), (6) and (7) read `NOT (group applies) OR n AT MOST 0`, which parses as NOT (group applies OR n AT MOST 0); they now read (NOT (group applies)) OR n AT MOST 0.
-- With a number of the report or the evaluation of 0 or less nothing is owed, whether or not the group applies: the four traces below answer FULFILLED.
-- Run against the file as it stood before the fix, the same four traces did not answer FULFILLED (see notes/P9-NOTES.md and NOTES.md, section 'Merge decisions').
