-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(3) the duty of the Commission to submit the report on the evaluation and review of this Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) 0 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2036))
-- args: date asked, number of the report, the day from which the time is counted
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 112(6) the duty of the Commission to submit the report on standardisation deliverables` (Date 2 8 2026) 0 (Date 2 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
